  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy suppert for finalising the UNEP-CCC funding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the consultancy is to support the MFA in the process of financial closure of the UNEP-DTU (UDP) grant and full transition from DTU, and to conduct the financial review of the new UNEP-CCC set-up. The financial review will focus on the Centre&#x2019;s financial administration set-up and procedures (including also the foreseen new Operations and Procedures Manual for the Centre), as well as the financial outlook of the centre.</narrative>
  </description>
